1\\le i\\le m$ and $1\\le j\\le n.$\n\nFinally, the upper Riemann sum is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}U(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}(3{x}_{i}+4{y}_{j}+15)Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the missing expression is $3{x}_{i}+4{y}_{j}+15.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186345075 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186179667 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "db8e7d68-5731-5a44-b86e-919a13689540" :knowledge-point/title "Writing an Upper Riemann Sum for a Strictly Increasing Function"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1f6854fa-7139-558f-b57b-4bd3187fea3e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4{x}_{i-1}+5{y}_{j}+23" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186342498} {:answer/id #uuid "513f1ff9-e65d-5f1a-8571-1816418fec0d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4{x}_{i-1}+5{y}_{j-1}+23" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186342909} {:answer/id #uuid "64ef0420-2f26-587b-b453-fc2e48dfcb0b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{x}_{i-1}+5{y}_{j-1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186343093} {:answer/id #uuid "681cfcaa-b068-55f2-bc5b-a9a04b24b8b8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{x}_{i}+5{y}_{j}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186343125} {:answer/id #uuid "90e405d6-0943-5cf2-80c8-b1fd2133c095" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4{x}_{i}+5{y}_{j}+23" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186343506}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "90e405d6-0943-5cf2-80c8-b1fd2133c095" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4{x}_{i}+5{y}_{j}+23" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186343506} :answer-field/id #uuid "1eee7566-f0d5-55e7-8b0c-ac1988d591c6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186344545}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "530d5a67-cefe-5c48-98d5-ffff81b541b7" :question/math-academy-id "q-75331" :question/problem "Let $R=[1,5]\\times [3,7]$ be a region in the $xy$-plane, and let $f(x,y)=4x+5y+23.$\nFurther, let $P$ be a partition of $R,$ where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{P}_{1}=\\{{x}_{0},{x}_{1},…,{x}_{m}\\},\\,{P}_{2}=\\{{y}_{0},{y}_{1},…,{y}_{n}\\},\\,P={P}_{1}\\times {P}_{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nGiven that the upper Riemann sum of $f$ with respect to $P$ is given by\n\n$$\nU(f,P)={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}\\boxed{}\\,Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\n$$\n\nwhere $Δ{x}_{i}={x}_{i}-{x}_{i-1}$ and $Δ{y}_{j}={y}_{j}-{y}_{j-1},$ what is the missing expression in the double summation above?" :question/worked-solution "The upper Riemann sum is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}U(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{M}_{ij}Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${M}_{ij}$ is the *maximum* value of $f$ in each subregion ${R}_{ij}.$ \n\nWe consider an arbitrary subregion ${R}_{ij}$ of the partition. This subregion lies between ${x}_{i-1}$ and ${x}_{i}$ over the $x$-axis and ${y}_{i-1}$ and ${y}_{i}$ over the $y$-axis, as shown below. \n\n![](images/88/88ffe30ae5401e00502b35d851b216768aad69bf94236561617adf23e1ce058f.png)\n\nNotice that:\n\n- $f(x,y)=4x+5y+23$ increases as $x$ increases, and\n\n- $f(x,y)=4x+5y+23$ increases as $y$ increases.\n\n![](images/67/67daa328cc6ae4cb37be386c327fb4548844fad2adc10476bdf1147c5a5d4218.png)\n\nAs a result, the *maximum* value of $f$ in each subregion is attained when we have the *largest* possible $x$ and the *largest* possible $y.$ This is the value at the *top right corner* of each subregion. \n\n![](images/6e/6e58954fccd74eaf67c95df818c4c9050c35b324c5fffe4902a366cb295b8845.png)\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{M}_{ij} & =f({x}_{i},{y}_{j})=4{x}_{i}+5{y}_{j}+23\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nfor all $1\\le i\\le m$ and $1\\le j\\le n.$\n\nFinally, the upper Riemann sum is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}U(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}(4{x}_{i}+5{y}_{j}+23)Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the missing expression is $4{x}_{i}+5{y}_{j}+23.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186345077 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186179667 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "db8e7d68-5731-5a44-b86e-919a13689540" :knowledge-point/title "Writing an Upper Riemann Sum for a Strictly Increasing Function"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "00f9bc81-7c18-5d3c-b4e0-f56976d188d5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "11{x}_{i}^{2}+13{y}_{j}^{2}-9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186342252} {:answer/id #uuid "2d56bfb3-5ca3-5bd0-b2d6-549c4d269b09" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3{x}_{i-1}^{2}+5{y}_{j-1}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186342617} {:answer/id #uuid "6320b9b2-455d-5b6f-8638-6bdeb7ae509a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "11{x}_{i-1}^{2}+13{y}_{j-1}^{2}-9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186343076} {:answer/id #uuid "cd065d58-96a8-55d3-9eaf-c2a3c7f448ed" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "11{x}_{i-1}^{2}+13{y}_{j}^{2}-9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186344046} {:answer/id #uuid "e91965b5-eaff-5ad1-96dc-04f4ed4337ad" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3{x}_{i}^{2}+5{y}_{j}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186344278}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "00f9bc81-7c18-5d3c-b4e0-f56976d188d5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "11{x}_{i}^{2}+13{y}_{j}^{2}-9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186342252} :answer-field/id #uuid "d7e8c5e3-7f96-580c-a496-c86bd6eec7d3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186344866}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "f55ed183-3158-517a-97cc-461a9f083ba8" :question/math-academy-id "q-75334" :question/problem "Let $R=[1,7]\\times [3,5]$ be a region in the $xy$-plane, and let $f(x,y)=11{x}^{2}+13{y}^{2}-9.$ Further, let $P$ be a partition of $R,$ where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{P}_{1}=\\{{x}_{0},{x}_{1},…,{x}_{m}\\},\\,{P}_{2}=\\{{y}_{0},{y}_{1},…,{y}_{n}\\},\\,P={P}_{1}\\times {P}_{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nGiven that the upper Riemann sum of $f$ with respect to $P$ is given by\n\n$$\nU(f,P)={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}\\boxed{}\\,Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\n$$\n\nwhere $Δ{x}_{i}={x}_{i}-{x}_{i-1}$ and $Δ{y}_{j}={y}_{j}-{y}_{j-1},$ what is the missing expression in the double summation above?" :question/worked-solution "The upper Riemann sum is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}U(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{M}_{ij}Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${M}_{ij}$ is the *maximum* value of $f$ in each subregion ${R}_{ij}.$ \n\nWe consider an arbitrary subregion ${R}_{ij}$ of the partition. This subregion lies between ${x}_{i-1}$ and ${x}_{i}$ over the $x$-axis and ${y}_{i-1}$ and ${y}_{i}$ over the $y$-axis, as shown below. \n\n![](images/88/88ffe30ae5401e00502b35d851b216768aad69bf94236561617adf23e1ce058f.png)\n\nNotice that:\n\n- $f(x,y)=11{x}^{2}+13{y}^{2}-9$ increases as $x$ increases on $[1,7],$ and\n\n- $f(x,y)=11{x}^{2}+13{y}^{2}-9$ increases as $y$ increases on $[3,5].$\n\n![](images/67/67daa328cc6ae4cb37be386c327fb4548844fad2adc10476bdf1147c5a5d4218.png)\n\nAs a result, the *maximum* value of $f$ in each subregion is attained when we have the *largest* possible $x$ and the *largest* possible $y.$ This is the value at the *top right corner* of each subregion. \n\n![](images/6e/6e58954fccd74eaf67c95df818c4c9050c35b324c5fffe4902a366cb295b8845.png)\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{M}_{ij} & =f({x}_{i},{y}_{j})=11{x}_{i}^{2}+13{y}_{j}^{2}-9\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nfor all $1\\le i\\le m$ and $1\\le j\\le n.$\n\nFinally, the upper Riemann sum is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}U(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}(11{x}_{i}^{2}+13{y}_{j}^{2}-9)Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the missing expression is $11{x}_{i}^{2}+13{y}_{j}^{2}-9.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186544827 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186179667 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "db8e7d68-5731-5a44-b86e-919a13689540" :knowledge-point/title "Writing an Upper Riemann Sum for a Strictly Increasing Function"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1c785b91-7dde-5c69-9861-fa00efbba2e4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3{x}_{i-1}^{2}+8{y}_{j-1}^{2}-21" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186544145} {:answer/id #uuid "33a66bf5-9641-5334-ad5f-e7355706f660" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3{x}_{i}^{2}+8{y}_{j}^{2}-21" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186544203} {:answer/id #uuid "811936de-ade0-5a26-bab4-f71405c258e8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3{x}_{i-1}^{2}+4{y}_{j-1}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186544369} {:answer/id #uuid "be670f96-af2f-5104-ba75-1e1058afe3cc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3{x}_{i}^{2}+8{y}_{j-1}^{2}-21" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186544491} {:answer/id #uuid "bfa43db7-19ee-5a17-8c9b-140beab4ca12" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3{x}_{i}^{2}+4{y}_{j}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186544496}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "33a66bf5-9641-5334-ad5f-e7355706f660" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3{x}_{i}^{2}+8{y}_{j}^{2}-21" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186544203} :answer-field/id #uuid "b1d583cc-f66e-5813-a082-71566d0d3d32" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/