$\n\\begin{aligned}{M}_{ij} & =f({x}_{i},{y}_{j})=3{x}_{i}^{2}+8{y}_{j}^{2}-21\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nfor all $1\\le i\\le m$ and $1\\le j\\le n.$\n\nFinally, the upper Riemann sum is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}U(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}(3{x}_{i}^{2}+8{y}_{j}^{2}-21)Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the missing expression is $3{x}_{i}^{2}+8{y}_{j}^{2}-21.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186544783 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186179667 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "db8e7d68-5731-5a44-b86e-919a13689540" :knowledge-point/title "Writing an Upper Riemann Sum for a Strictly Increasing Function"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0774869c-17ab-557f-8857-4480eb91d94a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12{x}_{i}^{2}+19{y}_{j}^{2}+3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186544106} {:answer/id #uuid "a75c733b-66fd-5d2d-9751-05d2cd9783b5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3{x}_{i}^{2}+13{y}_{j}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186544449} {:answer/id #uuid "a8d9e825-7bbf-5141-a98a-29f6476001ab" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12{x}_{i}^{2}+19{y}_{j-1}^{2}+3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186544450} {:answer/id #uuid "c9f36db2-863f-50b3-ab2c-fa08a9a54660" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3{x}_{i-1}^{2}+13{y}_{j-1}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186544510} {:answer/id #uuid "ee09c78c-70a8-5500-89c2-986568d17805" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12{x}_{i-1}^{2}+19{y}_{j-1}^{2}+3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186544602}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0774869c-17ab-557f-8857-4480eb91d94a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12{x}_{i}^{2}+19{y}_{j}^{2}+3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186544106} :answer-field/id #uuid "cdcd0ddb-2