es/6e/6e58954fccd74eaf67c95df818c4c9050c35b324c5fffe4902a366cb295b8845.png)\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{M}_{ij} & =f({x}_{i},{y}_{j})=12{x}_{i}^{2}+19{y}_{j}^{2}+3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nfor all $1\\le i\\le m$ and $1\\le j\\le n.$\n\nFinally, the upper Riemann sum is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}U(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}(12{x}_{i}^{2}+19{y}_{j}^{2}+3)Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the missing expression is $12{x}_{i}^{2}+19{y}_{j}^{2}+3.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186345078 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186179668 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "a5c07033-ef84-52e6-bd08-b1f0cc289e9f" :knowledge-point/title "Writing an Upper Riemann Sum for a Strictly Decreasing Function"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "41ddc72c-615c-541d-8961-c0880340e841" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "17-{x}_{i}-4{y}_{j-1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186342783} {:answer/id #uuid "79ba0450-82c1-57d9-aaf1-30d1c0640468" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6{x}_{i-1}-{y}_{j-1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186343287} {:answer/id #uuid "a97a641f-2c97-5a75-9db7-b8be304af56d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6{x}_{i-1}-{y}_{j}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186343730} {:answer/id #uuid "af22a106-9a5a-59bf-9807-18a249eb20aa" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "17-{x}_{i-1}-4{y}_{j}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186343780} {:answer/id #uuid "f1508726-9a07-5966-8c39-aa644818c98b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "17-{x}_{i-1}-4{y}_{j-1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186344361}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f1508726-9a07-5966-8c39-aa644818c98b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "17-{x}_{i-1}-4{y}_{j-1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186344361} :answer-field/id #uuid "042f4f04-14a9-50ca-b216-67a4f4f6e739" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186344502}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "3c141118-06d6-5a2b-a87c-5df9a266bd71" :question/math-academy-id "q-75338" :question/problem "Let $R=[-8,-3]\\times [-6,-1]$ be a region in the $xy$-plane, and let $f(x,y)=17-x-4y.$\nFurther, let $P$ be a partition of $R,$ where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{P}_{1}=\\{{x}_{0},{x}_{1},…,{x}_{m}\\},\\,{P}_{2}=\\{{y}_{0},{y}_{1},…,{y}_{n}\\},\\,P={P}_{1}\\times {P}_{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nGiven that the upper Riemann sum of $f$ with respect to $P$ is given by\n\n$$\nU(f,P)={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}\\boxed{}\\,Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\n$$\n\nwhere $Δ{x}_{i}={x}_{i}-{x}_{i-1}$ and $Δ{y}_{j}={y}_{j}-{y}_{j-1},$ what is the missing expression in the double summation above?" :question/worked-solution "The upper Riemann sum is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}U(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{M}_{ij}Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${M}_{ij}$ is the *maximum* value of $f$ in each subregion ${R}_{ij}.$ \n\nWe consider an arbitrary subregion ${R}_{ij}$ of the partition. This subregion lies between ${x}_{i-1}$ and ${x}_{i}$ over the $x$-axis and ${y}_{i-1}$ and ${y}_{i}$ over the $y$-axis, as shown below. \n\n![](images/88/88ffe30ae5401e00502b35d851b216768aad69bf94236561617adf23e1ce058f.png)\n\nNotice that:\n\n- $f(x,y)=17-x-4y$ decreases as $x$ increases, and\n\n- $f(x,y)=17-x-4y$ decreases as $y$ increases.\n\n![](images/ce/ce0d90127e1f14654f4b32a933f1eb6e76e054c03f19ca40c3f04116aa3c2c93.png)\n\nAs a result, the *maximum* value of $f$ in each subregion is attained when we have the *smallest* possible $x$ and the *smallest* possible $y.$ This is the value at the *bottom left corner* of each subregion. \n\n![](images/5b/5b9967c814e46914e0409854de0960e85339adc9b9fd9693677c8e048c342702.png)\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{M}_{ij} & =f({x}_{i-1},{y}_{j-1})=17-{x}_{i-1}-4{y}_{j-1}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nfor all $1\\le i\\le m$ and $1\\le j\\le n.$\n\nFinally, the upper Riemann sum is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}U(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}(17-{x}_{i-1}-4{y}_{j-1})Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the missing expression is $17-{x}_{i-1}-4{y}_{j-1}.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186393528 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186179668 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "a5c07033-ef84-52e6-bd08-b1f0cc289e9f" :knowledge-point/title "Writing an Upper Riemann Sum for a Strictly Decreasing Function"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1821ae6a-bd49-520a-8a7c-7c7e55df6111" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6{x}_{i-1}-5{y}_{j-1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186393530} {:answer/id #uuid "13b6467d-5d9a-5dbd-8b7b-066a16440398" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5{x}_{i-1}-11{y}_{j}-8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186393531} {:answer/id #uuid "92c45e43-6e67-5cb7-8ec7-530d79ac1e1b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5{x}_{i-1}-11{y}_{j-1}-8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186393532} {:answer/id #uuid "9cb1b2dd-be61-5721-9314-63261594fa1c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6{x}_{i}-5{y}_{j}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186393533} {:answer/id #uuid "62773e10-1c9d-5f39-993b-f15df8ff06d5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5{x}_{i}-11{y}_{j}-8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186393534}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "92c45e43-6e67-5cb7-8ec7-530d79ac1e1b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5{x}_{i-1}-11{y}_{j-1}-8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186393532} :answer-field/id #uuid "6e7bae9e-1528-562e-a4f8-be92063c8e44" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186393529}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "152f7780-3f2e-5440-94cb-e0ee73bf2d20" :question/math-academy-id "q-75340" :question/problem "Let $R=[0,7]\\times [-6,-5]$ be a region in the $xy$-plane, and let $f(x,y)=-5x-11y-8.$\nFurther, let $P$ be a partition of $R,$ where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{P}_{1}=\\{{x}_{0},{x}_{1},…,{x}_{m}\\},\\,{P}_{2}=\\{{y}_{0},{y}_{1},…,{y}_{n}\\},\\,P={P}_{1}\\times {P}_{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nGiven that the upper Riemann sum of $f$ with respect to $P$ is given by\n\n$$\nU(f,P)={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}\\boxed{}\\,Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\n$$\n\nwhere $Δ{x}_{i}={x}_{i}-{x}_{i-1}$ and $Δ{y}_{j}={y}_{j}-{y}_{j-1},$ what is the missing expression in the double summation above?" :question/worked-solution "The upper Riemann sum is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}U(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{M}_{ij}Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${M}_{ij}$ is the *maximum* value of $f$ in each subregion ${R}_{ij}.$ \n\nWe consider an arbitrary subregion ${R}_{ij}$ of the partition. This subregion lies between ${x}_{i-1}$ and ${x}_{i}$ over the $x$-axis and ${y}_{i-1}$ and ${y}_{i}$ over the $y$-axis, as shown below. \n\n![](images/88/88ffe30ae5401e00502b35d851b216768aad69bf94236561617adf23e1ce058f.png)\n\nNotice that:\n\n- $f(x,y)=-5x-11y-8$ decreases as $x$ increases, and\n\n- $f(x,y)=-5x-11y-8$ decreases as $y$ increases.\n\n![](images/ce/ce0d90127e1f14654f4b32a933f1eb6e76e054c03f19ca40c3f04116aa3c2c93.png)\n\nAs a result, the *maximum* value of $f$ in each subregion is attained when we have the *smallest* possible $x$ and the *smallest* possible $y.$ This is the value at the *bottom left corner* of each subregion. \n\n![](images/5b/5b9967c814e46914e0409854de0960e85339adc9b9fd9693677c8e048c342702.png)\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{M}_{ij} & =f({x}_{i-1},{y}_{j-1})=-5{x}_{i-1}-11{y}_{j-1}-8\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nfor all $1\\le i\\le m$ and $1\\le j\\le n.$\n\nFinally, the upper Riemann sum is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}U(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}(-5{x}_{i-1}-11{y}_{j-1}-8)Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the missing expression is $-5{x}_{i-1}-11{y}_{j-1}-8.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186544851 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186179668 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "a5c07033-ef84-52e6-bd08-b1f0cc289e9f" :knowledge-point/title "Writing an Upper Riemann Sum for a Strictly Decreasing Function"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1cfc5863-10cb-5335-a148-db1b1bd8a278" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "30-7{x}_{i-1}^{2}-{y}_{j-1}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186544149} {:answer/id #uuid "9505f95f-c4ca-5a9e-9b47-c966b0831bbd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{x}_{i-1}^{2}+2{y}_{j}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186544413} {:answer/id #uuid "a17fd14c-4cbd-5250-9e97-2fa1d30d04c9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{x}_{i-1}^{2}+2{y}_{j-1}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186544437} {:answer/id #uuid "a65ac1d2-a5e8-5ab2-8ba3-b59029d1c01a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "30-7{x}_{i}^{2}-{y}_{j}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186544446} {:answer/id #uuid "f6989548-b253-5d58-9496-78aaaa7ae19f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "30-7{x}_{i-1}^{2}-{y}_{j}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186544626}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1cfc5863-10cb-5335-a148-db1b1bd8a278" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "30-7{x}_{i-1}^{2}-{y}_{j-1}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref