tom left corner* of each subregion. \n\n![](images/5b/5b9967c814e46914e0409854de0960e85339adc9b9fd9693677c8e048c342702.png)\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{M}_{ij} & =f({x}_{i-1},{y}_{j-1})=30-7{x}_{i-1}^{2}-{y}_{j-1}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nfor all $1\\le i\\le m$ and $1\\le j\\le n.$\n\nFinally, the upper Riemann sum is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}U(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}(30-7{x}_{i-1}^{2}-{y}_{j-1}^{2})Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the missing expression is $30-7{x}_{i-1}^{2}-{y}_{j-1}^{2}.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186345080 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186179668 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "a5c07033-ef84-52e6-bd08-b1f0cc289e9f" :knowledge-point/title "Writing an Upper Riemann Sum for a Strictly Decreasing Function"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2979c980-3839-5f0a-8861-0d25335d644b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2{x}_{i}^{2}+3{y}_{j}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186342587} {:answer/id #uuid "987ae513-88b4-5b7b-8d21-ece8494178f5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "135-4{x}_{i-1}^{2}-13{y}_{j}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186343577} {:answer/id #uuid "d73a1f41-67a1-5721-9023-71716444ec73" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2{x}_{i-1}^{2}+3{y}_{j-1}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186344128} {:answer/id #uuid "e4873559-c970-5e2b-9ead-0c235e6ed87e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "135-4{x}_{i-1}^{2}-13{y}_{j-1}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186344246} {:answer/id #uuid "ee0246d2-cfba-5e9b-bfd7-f55506df8fef" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "135-4{x}_{i}^{2}-13{y}_{j}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186344331}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e4873559-c970-5e2b-9ead-0c235e6ed87e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "135-4{x}_{i-1}^{2}-13{y}_{j-1}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186344246} :answer-field/id #uuid "d6c61f20-964d-5fbd-bc9a-4389fca13f23" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186344865}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "4a7ff47e-0ab5-5f95-8bbf-9c068f902322" :question/math-academy-id "q-75344" :question/problem "Let $R=[1,2]\\times [2,3]$ be a region in the $xy$-plane, and let $f(x,y)=135-4{x}^{2}-13{y}^{2}.$ Further, let $P$ be a partition of $R,$ where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{P}_{1}=\\{{x}_{0},{x}_{1},…,{x}_{m}\\},\\,{P}_{2}=\\{{y}_{0},{y}_{1},…,{y}_{n}\\},\\,P={P}_{1}\\times {P}_{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nGiven that the upper Riemann sum of $f$ with respect to $P$ is given by\n\n$$\nU(f,P)={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}\\boxed{}\\,Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\n$$\n\nwhere $Δ{x}_{i}={x}_{i}-{x}_{i-1}$ and $Δ{y}_{j}={y}_{j}-{y}_{j-1},$ what is the missing expression in the double summation above?" :question/worked-solution "The upper Riemann sum is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}U(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{M}_{ij}Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${M}_{ij}$ is the *maximum* value of $f$ in each subregion ${R}_{ij}.$ \n\nWe consider an arbitrary subregion ${R}_{ij}$ of the partition. This subregion lies between ${x}_{i-1}$ and ${x}_{i}$ over the $x$-axis and ${y}_{i-1}$ and ${y}_{i}$ over the $y$-axis, as shown below. \n\n![](images/88/88ffe30ae5401e00502b35d851b216768aad69bf94236561617adf23e1ce058f.png)\n\nNotice that:\n\n- $f(x,y)=135-4{x}^{2}-13{y}^{2}$ decreases as $x$ increases on $[1,2],$ and\n\n- $f(x,y)=135-4{x}^{2}-13{y}^{2}$ decreases as $y$ increases on $[2,3].$\n\n![](images/ce/ce0d90127e1f14654f4b32a933f1eb6e76e054c03f19ca40c3f04116aa3c2c93.png)\n\nAs a result, the *maximum* value of $f$ in each subregion is attained when we have the *smallest* possible $x$ and the *smallest* possible $y.$ This is the value at the *bottom left corner* of each subregion. \n\n![](images/5b/5b9967c814e46914e0409854de0960e85339adc9b9fd9693677c8e048c342702.png)\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{M}_{ij} & =f({x}_{i-1},{y}_{j-1})=135-4{x}_{i-1}^{2}-13{y}_{j-1}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nfor all $1\\le i\\le m$ and $1\\le j\\le n.$\n\nFinally, the upper Riemann sum is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}U(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}(135-4{x}_{i-1}^{2}-13{y}_{j-1}^{2})Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the missing expression is $135-4{x}_{i-1}^{2}-13{y}_{j-1}^{2}.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186544854 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186179727 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "b815d42d-8e8a-5036-b6c4-76e4c20b20b7" :knowledge-point/title "Writing an Upper Riemann Sum for a Function That’s Neither Strictly Increasing nor Decreasing"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1844e6f9-d3f7-592f-a4e7-94876f5aa91c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4{x}_{i}-7{y}_{j}+8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186544138} {:answer/id #uuid "8dd39250-f64f-534c-a6a8-0df2efc4e38e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2{x}_{i}+7{y}_{j-1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186544393} {:answer/id #uuid "af042d8b-3aec-5864-a14e-8d95c4e5559b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2{x}_{i-1}+7{y}_{j}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186544458} {:answer/id #uuid "ba18a7f8-97b5-59e7-a2f1-073cd338f901" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4{x}_{i}-7{y}_{j-1}+8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186544482} {:answer/id #uuid "ce01a2a2-1a32-54dd-b84a-7836fba67bbc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4{x}_{i-1}-7{y}_{j}+8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186544523}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ba18a7f8-97b5-59e7-a2f1-073cd338f901" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4{x}_{i}-7{y}_{j-1}+8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186544482} :answer-field/id #uuid "aba656f0-e898-54a7-a1c1-6750e9415410" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186544733}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "9c397521-c62f-5e70-81fc-4938ad811121" :question/math-academy-id "q-75346" :question/problem "Let $R=[2,7]\\times [-13,-5]$ be a region in the $xy$-plane, and let $f(x,y)=4x-7y+8.$\nFurther, let $P$ be a partition of $R,$ where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{P}_{1}=\\{{x}_{0},{x}_{1},…,{x}_{m}\\},\\,{P}_{2}=\\{{y}_{0},{y}_{1},…,{y}_{n}\\},\\,P={P}_{1}\\times {P}_{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nGiven that the upper Riemann sum of $f$ with respect to $P$ is given by\n\n$$\nU(f,P)={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}\\boxed{}\\,Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\n$$\n\nwhere $Δ{x}_{i}={x}_{i}-{x}_{i-1}$ and $Δ{y}_{j}={y}_{j}-{y}_{j-1},$\nwhat is the missing expression in the double summation above?" :question/worked-solution "The upper Riemann sum is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}U(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{M}_{ij}Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${M}_{ij}$ is the *maximum* value of $f$ in each subregion ${R}_{ij}.$ \n\nWe consider an arbitrary subregion ${R}_{ij}$ of the partition. This subregion lies between ${x}_{i-1}$ and ${x}_{i}$ over the $x$-axis and ${y}_{i-1}$ and ${y}_{i}$ over the $y$-axis, as shown below.\n\n![](images/88/88ffe30ae5401e00502b35d851b216768aad69bf94236561617adf23e1ce058f.png)\n\nNotice that:\n\n- $f(x,y)=4x-7y+8$ increases as $x$ increases, and\n\n- $f(x,y)=4x-7y+8$ decreases as $y$ increases.\n\n![](images/01/01b291ca7cd81b88cf6ed06fdcdb2ffcbb1f78255d0f57d496823d347c2fb0b3.png)\n\nAs a result, the *maximum* value of $f$ in each subregion is attained when we have the *largest* possible $x$ and the *smallest* possible $y.$ This is the value at the *bottom right corner* of each subregion.\n\n![](images/de/de36b521dea1f925754a9c630c3d4a2c405c087a191138f1eaaa5771becb8c21.png)\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{M}_{ij} & =f({x}_{i},{y}_{j-1})=4{x}_{i}-7{y}_{j-1}+8\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nfor all $1\\le i\\le m$ and $1\\le j\\le n.$\n\nFinally, the upper Riemann sum is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}U(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}(4{x}_{i}-7{y}_{j-1}+8)Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the missing expression is $4{x}_{i}-7{y}_{j-1}+8.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186364385 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186179727 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "b815d42d-8e8a-5036-b6c4-76e4c20b20b7" :knowledge-point/title "Writing an Upper Riemann Sum for a Function That’s Neither Strictly Increasing nor Decreasing"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f665a77f-fea4-5b4d-9da5-64f516b4c035" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3{y}_{j}-8{x}_{i-1}-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186364387} {:answer/id #uuid "61009d18-64c9-53ae-8f81-65c59166a8b9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3{y}_{j}-8{x}_{i}-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186364388} {:answer/id #uuid "b1869de2-bd78-5da9-95fb-94a749f1c329" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3{y}_{j-1}+2{x}_{i-1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186364389} {:answer/id #uuid "e804afea-159d-56bc-a8a8-c407be2f9a27" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3{y}_{j-1}-8{x}_{i-1}-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186364390} {:answer/id #uuid "d2ac214c-9cc6-511a-840b-f4c8d44eaf1b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3{y}_{j}+2{x}_{i-1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186364391}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f665a77f-fea4-5b4d-9da5-64f516b4c035" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3{y}_{j}-8{x}_{i-1}-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186364387} :answer-field/id #uuid "6fb26ff9-2dfa-5feb-b194-79e89d9834ec" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186364386}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "3798cf3e-6725-5326-a41b-00cdf3afc1bb" :question/math-academy-id "q-75347" :question/problem "Let $R=[2,3]\\times [11,13]$ be a region in the $xy$-plane, and let $f(x,y)=3y-8x-6.$\nFurther, let $P$ be a partition of $R,$ where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{P}_{1}=\\{{x}_{0},{x}_{1},…,{x}_{m}\\},\\,{P}_{2}=\\{{y}_{0},{y}_{1},…,{y}_{n}\\},\\,P={P}_{1}\\times {P}_{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nGiven that the upper Riemann sum of $f$ with respect to $P$ is given by\n\n$$\nU(f,P)={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}\\boxed{}\\,Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\n$$\n\nwhere $Δ{x}_{i}={x}_{i}-{x}_{i-1}$ and $Δ{y}_{j}={y}_{j}-{y}_{j-1},$ what is the missing expression in the double summation above?" :question/worked-solution "The upper Riemann sum is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}U(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{M}_{ij}Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${M}_{ij}$ is the *maximum* value of $f$ in each subregion ${R}_{ij}.$ \n\nWe consider an arbitrary subregion ${R}_{ij}$ of the partition. This subregion lies between ${x}_{i-1}$ and ${x}_{i}$ over the $x$-axis and ${y}_{i-1}$ and ${y}_{i}$ over the $y$-axis, as shown below.\n\n![](images/88/88ffe30ae5401e00502b35d851b216768aad69bf94236561617adf23e1ce058f.png)\n\nNotice that:\n\n- $f(x,y)=3y-8x-6$ decreases as $x$ increases, and\n\n- $f(x,y)=3y-8x-6$ increases as $y$ increases.\n\n![](images/ff/ffa57d3e7fed08212f12d4b9d7c2e0a4d33a3aac71c8b8a03d1a9a7364484deb.png)\n\nAs a result, the *maximum* value of $f$ in each subregion is attained when we have the *smallest* possible $x$ and the *largest* possible $y.$ This is the value at the *top left corner* of each subregion.\n\n![](images/74/74d546d91e145efea49b70af56cb472e8bbbd1417725cd7fa92a3a278cad75ea.png)\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{M}_{ij} & =f({x}_{i-1},{y}_{j})=3{y}_{j}-8{x}_{i-1}-6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nfor all $1\\le i\\le m$ and $1\\le j\\le n.$\n\nFinally, the upper Riemann sum is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}U(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}(3{y}_{j}-8{x}_{i-1}-6)Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the missing expression is $3{y}_{j}-8{x}_{i-1}-6.$"}]}
